    date "2020-12-08T12:00:14Z"
    title "5 MIN FLAT BELLY PILATES AB Workout//NO EQUIPMENT//14 Day Challenge"
    description "Hey guys,&#10;&#10;Woohoo! It&#8217;s our last week of wellness month! Can you believe that? I feel like these last few weeks went by so quickly! I hope you guys have enjoyed it as much as I have! Here&#8217;s another Pilates inspired ab workout that I love to do at home when I need to strengthen and tighten my core. Let me know what you think in the comments below - also what are everyone&#8217;s holiday plans?&#10;&#10;xx&#10;&#10;Sanne&#10;&#10;Thankyou so much @Alo Yoga  for being to able to use the studio!&#10;&#10;Wearing:&#10;&#10;Sanne Alo Bottom - Beige: https://bit.ly/3gziB2P&#10;Sanne Alo Bra- Beige: https://bit.ly/2VRy4St&#10;&#10;Sami Alo Bottom- Beige: https://bit.ly/36YCEEP&#10;Sami Alo Bra &#8211; Olive: https://bit.ly/2VRy4St&#10;&#10;&#10;Follow me!&#10;Instagram: @sannevloet (https://bit.ly/2vlnHLy)&#10;Twitter: @sannevloet (https://bit.ly/2OKggYH)&#10;Subscribe!!! https://bit.ly/2KzihS5&#10;&#10;Follow the link to my gear page with everything I use to create content - B&#38;H Photo - https://bhpho.to/34XSsaj&#10;&#10;Music: &#10;I used music from Epidemic Sound -  http://share.epidemicsound.com/GVgBV&#10;I used music from Music Bed - http://share.mscbd.fm/sannevloet"
