  [
    id 159
    label "cLO4uRh4xDE"
    step 0
    date "2020-10-28T05:00:07Z"
    title "10 MIN ABS WITH WEIGHTS - for an extra strong core! you can also use a bottle of water I Pamela Reif"
    description "grab your bottle of water, a pack of oat milk or 1kg of rice - I'm sure you can find something in your kitchen!  &#9829;&#65038; / Werbung &#10;&#10;PS: if you don't want to use any weights, that's totally fine! You can also perform all exercises without a piece of equipment :) &#10;&#10;EXERCISES: &#10;&#9656; the CRAWL is hard with coordination, I know hahaha. Start slow &#38; then you quickly get the hang out of it.&#10;&#9656; We switch it up between weighted movements &#38; bodyweight burners, to really challenge our inner sixpack&#10;&#9656; we have a couple of new exercises in there! Hope you like them!!  &#9829;&#65038;&#10;&#10;TECHNIQUE:&#10;&#9656; If we lay down on our back, make sure to keep your LOWER BACK flat on the mat. Only lower your legs as far as possible, so your lower back is not lifting off the mat! &#10;&#9656; THINK about your tummy muscles working the entire time. It's about the mind muscle connection! Lift and lower your legs with the strength of your abs, not your thighs. &#10;&#9656; try to hold the tension in your abs as long as possible. Squeeze in your belly button &#34;towards your spine&#34; (inwards) and enjoy the burn :) &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;Equipment: 4kg dumbbell &#10;Alternatives: big water bottle, pack of rice / oats / other grains, pack of milk, no equipment &#10;&#10;Otherwise we have no breaks (you're used to it by now I guess) and not much space is needed :) If you need a break tho - take it! Just don't quit! &#10;&#10;The video is in full length which means you can just follow whatever I&#8217;m doing 30s for each exercise. &#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#9656; you can find FREE WORKOUT PLANS on my Instagram Channel. 30min, 45min and Beginner Friendly combinations. Check out the Highlight Bubble &#34;Workout Plans&#34; for that.  &#10;&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10;&#9656; use #PamelaReif if you want me to see your workout pics and videos! &#10;&#10;__&#10; &#10;&#9656; You can always find ALL SONGS in my workout playlist. I update it weekly &#38; it's available on Spotify, Apple Music, etc. &#9829;&#65038;&#10;http://wmg.click/GetActive&#10;&#10;1. Cash Cash - Love You Now (ft. Georgia Ku) 0:00 - 2:50&#10;2. Robin Schulz ft. KIDDO - All We Got 2:51 - 5:50 &#10;3. Sonny Fodera &#38; Elly Eyre - Wired 5:51 - 9:08&#10;4. Jub&#235;l ft. NEIMY - Dancing In The Moonlight (Ti&#235;sto Remix) 9:09 - 10:50&#10;&#10;__&#10;&#10;&#10142; Instagram http://www.instagram.com/pamela_rf/&#10;&#10142; Food Account http://www.instagram.com/pamgoesnuts/&#10;__&#10;&#10;Business Contact:&#10;pamela_reif@icloud.com&#10;&#10;__&#10;unterst&#252;tzt durch Warner Music Germany&#10;&#10;Disclaimer:&#10;When joining me for this workout video, you need to take some precautions as your health and safety is the most important. To avoid any injury or harm, you need to check your health with your doctor before exercising. By performing any fitness exercises without supervision like with this video, you are performing them at your own risk. See a fitness professional to give you advice on your exercise form. Pamela Reif will not be responsible or liable for any injury or harm you sustain as a result of this video."
