    title "INTENSE 10MIN AB WORKOUT | GET THE 11 LINE ABS, FEEL THE BURN"
    description "GET INTENSE AND SWEATY WITH ME!&#10;Hello everyone, welcome back! I hope you guys enjoyed the workout because I definitely did! It is intense but it's doable. Remember to breathe with control, engage your core (tighten as if you were getting punched in the stomach), and go at your own pace! Did you have a good time? Let me know in the comments~&#10;Thank you for watching, and...&#10;LIKE &#38; SUBSCRIBE!!!&#10;See you soon loves &#9829;&#65038;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; S O C I A L M E D I A&#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/elizvchu/&#10;TikTok: https://vm.tiktok.com/ZMJu9PXGh/&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; V I D E O S&#10;What I Eat In A Week pt.2: https://youtu.be/W3ccgpKHg-8&#10;Lower Body Workout: https://youtu.be/nV52k6tMUhk&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; L I N K S &#10;https://acta.grsm.io/ELIZVCHU&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; f t. E X E R C I S E S&#10;1. Jack knives+crunch claps &#10;2. Jack knives &#10;3. Elbow v-sit in out and leg lift &#10;4. Elbow v-sit M lift &#10;5. V-sit crunch+leg lift L&#10;6. Other side R&#10;7. V-Crunches pulses&#10;8. One leg bike &#10;9. Other side &#10;10. Heel taps &#10;11. Straight leg roll ups &#10;12. Leg lifts (hands behind head)&#10;13. Plank &#10;14. Side toe hold crunches&#10;15. other side &#10;16. Intense plank hold  &#10;17. Plank &#10;18. Ab hold &#10;19. Big flutters kicks&#10;20. Fast flutters kicks&#10;&#10;&#10;&#9789; M U S I C&#10;DJ Grumble Soundcloud: https://soundcloud.com/gbeats&#10;&#10; 2 Souls - Lonely (feat. Nara) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/FyFGUMyoias&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/Lonely&#10;&#10;Unknown Brain - Dead (ft. KAZHI) [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/qvQGMSWJm74&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/UBDead&#10;&#10;Unknown Brain - Dancing On The Moon [NCS Release]&#10;Music provided by NoCopyrightSounds.&#10;Watch: https://youtu.be/9EHXqi0ez54&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://ncs.io/DOTM&#10;&#10;Music by LiQWYD:&#10;https://www.soundcloud.com/liqwyd&#10;https://spoti.fi/2RPd66h&#10;https://apple.co/2TZtpeG&#10;https://www.instagram.com/liqwyd&#10;https://www.facebook.com/LiQWYD/&#10;https://www.patreon.com/LiQWYD&#10;&#10;&#10;For serious inquiries ONLY: theelizabethchu@gmail.com&#10;&#10;&#10;(Link included in this description may be affiliate link)"
