    id 298
    label "RAUyogkbzLs"
    step 0
    date "2021-05-21T16:00:30Z"
    title "MAMMA MIA AB WORKOUT (10 min)"
    description "Today's workout is a Mamma Mia Ab Workout! Today we'll be doing a 10 min ab workout to some of the best songs from the movie Mamma Mia! You don't need any equipment - just a place to comfortably lie down :) This is a no repeats workout, meaning we'll only be doing each exercise once! I hope you enjoy and be sure to leave any workout requests in the comments! #MammaMiaWorkout&#8203; #MammaMiaAbWorkout&#8203; #10MinAbWorkout&#8203;&#10;&#10;Songs:&#10;0:00&#8203; Intro&#10;0:36 Dancing Queen&#10;4:38 Mamma Mia&#10;8:07&#8203; Gimme! Gimme! Gimme! (A Man After Midnight)&#10;&#10;&#9734; MY HOME WORKOUT PROGRAM: https://dempseymarks.com/SHOP&#8203;&#8203; &#9734;&#10;&#10;&#187; more workouts &#171;&#10;&#10032; LAST UPLOAD:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=plN7NYy6uVY&#38;t=5s&#10;&#10032; TAYLOR SWIFT HIIT:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=S7tbZ...&#10;&#10032; ONE DIRECTION ABS:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=23kEq...&#10;&#10032; ARIANA GRANDE ABS:&#10;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Yiru...&#10;&#10; instagram: @dempseymarks&#10;&#8627;https://www.instagram.com/dempseymark...&#10;my website:&#10;&#8627;https://dempseymarks.com&#8203;&#8203;&#10; contact (business inquires): dempseymarks@gmail.com&#10;&#10;thanks for watching &#38; i hope you'll stick around and subscribe"
