    title "At home Pilates Bar Ab Workout"
    description "Hello my CaliFitt friends,&#10;&#10;     I am so excited to be sharing this new ab workout with you all. Of course as you all know, the only thing you will need to complete this exercise is your Pilates Bar ! This Ab workout will challenge you in terms of using your core, and lower body strength at times. It is important that you all pay close attention to the techniques of each exercise, that way you are performing them correctly. Thank you all for your love and support ! We are on the road to 700 subscribers, and I couldn&#8217;t be more grateful for you all! Each and every single day I am reminded of how amazing each one of you are. You all have truly been a great help in transforming my life. There is no way that I could thank you all enough. Don&#8217;t forget to like, comment, and share this video ! If you haven&#8217;t already joined the CaliFitt Family, just know that we would love to have you all join us ! So hit that subscribe button, abs turn on that notification bell ! I&#8217;ll see you all in the next video ! Peace !! #gymshark &#10;&#10;Workout clothes from @ gymshark&#10;&#10;Below you will find the music played within my workout video. I do not have or own the rights to any music played within this video. You will find the requested and required information for each of the songs, artist, and creators of the music listed below  ! &#10;1. Persuasion (Instrumental) by RYYZN https://soundcloud.com/ryyzn&#8203;&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported  &#8212; CC BY 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: https://bit.ly/-persuasion&#8203;&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/DWjFW7Yq1fA&#8203;&#10;2. Waited (instrumental) by RYYZN https://soundcloud.com/ryyzn&#8203;&#10;Creative Commons &#8212; Attribution 3.0 Unported  &#8212; CC BY 3.0&#10;Free Download / Stream: http://bit.ly/al-waited&#8203;&#10;Music promoted by Audio Library https://youtu.be/jJg0_gG-nCc&#8203;"
