    title "7 Minute High Intensity Ab Workout (FOLLOW ALONG!)"
    description "Get started on the easiest and most enjoyable workout program you've ever tried - http://vshred.fit/YTMOVE2021&#10;&#10;What&#8217;s going on guys! In today&#8217;s video, &#13;I am going to show you a 7 Minute High Intensity Ab Workout that you can do from home! Using this ab training method optimizes the way you train your abs, resulting in a better chance of losing the belly fat that hides them.&#10;&#10;This isn&#8217;t a standard ab workout where we guide you though some crunches and leg lifts.This workout is 7 minutes of high intensity ab training that will blast fat and activate your core simultaneously. I&#8217;m going to walk you through the workout step-by-step in a follow along style video.&#10;&#10;You will go from exercise-to-exercise, performing each movement for ONE MINUTE, without a break. After all 7 exercises are complete, you are done. Or you can take a short breather and repeat the circuit one more time. &#10;&#10;#AbWorkout #NoEquipmentNeeded #VShred&#10;&#10;&#128293; 7 MINUTE HIGH INTENSITY HOME AB WORKOUT  &#128293;&#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------&#10;&#9200; 1 minute - Knee Strikes&#10;&#9200; 1 minute - Bicycle Crunches&#10;&#9200; 1 minute - Plank Hops&#10;&#9200; 1 minute - Mountain Climbers&#10;&#9200; 1 minute - Crunch Get Ups&#10;&#9200; 1 minute - Plank Jacks&#10;&#9200; 1 minute - Dolphin Hops&#10;&#10;If you go at a fast pace and keep your core activated by drawing your belly button into your spine at all times, your heart will be pounding and your abs will be on fire!&#10;&#10;Check out MOVE Today: http://vshred.fit/YTMOVE2021&#10;&#10;&#128071; Trying out this Follow Along Workout? Drop a comment below and let me know how this helped you! Don't forget to subscribe for more videos as well!&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;7 Minute High Intensity Ab Workout (FOLLOW ALONG!)&#10;https://youtu.be/thJJ4huOlTQ&#10;--------------------------------------------------------------------&#13;&#10;Check out My Supplement Stacks! &#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;For Fat Loss: http://vshred.fit/YTFatLoss106&#10;&#13;&#10;For Muscle Building: http://vshred.fit/YTMuscleBuilder106&#10;-------------------------------------------------------------------&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Intro Song: Lights Go Down by Bazanji"
