    id 355
    label "XvO4oAAZ5iI"
    step 0
    date "2020-04-20T13:00:24Z"
    title "Post Pregnancy Ab Workout"
    description "&#8206;Post Pregnancy Ab Workout/// Let&#8217;s talk about core! I know how hard it can be getting those abs back after pregnancy.&#10;&#10;A lot of us go through different experiences after pregnancy getting our bodies back.&#10;&#10;The thing I hear most have trouble getting back is our ABS&#8230;&#10;&#10;Carrying our little ones for 9 months stretches out our abs and the other factor being the cravings we get during that time period.&#10;&#10;We pick up habits we wouldn&#8217;t usually have while we&#8217;re not pregnant.&#10;&#10;Getting your core back to where it was before isn&#8217;t impossible so don&#8217;t stress! It&#8217;s just gonna take being consistent in the gym and the kitchen.&#10;&#10;I got the perfect ab workout for you guys to get back in the game and on the way to having that tight tummy back!&#10;&#10;No need to pick up heavy weights right away.&#10;&#8291;&#8291;&#10;Take it easy in the beginning and work your way back up to where you want to be.&#10;&#8291;&#8291;&#10;First I will show you the moves&#8291;&#8291;, then we will do the workout together.&#8291;&#8291;&#10;&#8291;&#8291;&#10;Modify this workout however you need based on your level of experience!&#8291;&#8291;&#10;&#8291;&#8291;&#10;Feel like you can do more? &#10;&#10;Repeat the workout portion as needed.&#8291;&#8291;&#10;&#8291;&#8291;&#10;Let me know in the comments if this routine helped you, and drop any other questions or comments you have.&#8291;&#8291;&#10;&#8291;&#8291;&#10;If you guys need help or accountability getting to your fitness goals&#8230;&#8291;&#8291;&#10;&#8291;&#8291;&#10;Just message me on Instagram or Facebook and we can map out a plan to get there!&#8291;&#8291;&#10;&#8291;&#8291;&#10;We are here to help each other achieve our best lives!&#10;&#10;&#9654; Your FREE 1-Minute Ab Workout &#128073;  http://svelte.go2cloud.org/aff_c?offer_id=45&#38;aff_id=1337&#38;url_id=177&#38;source=SVG-YT&#13;&#10;&#10;http://www.sveltetraining.com/&#13