    title "Ab workout- Flat Stomach Home Workout"
    description "This workout routine is currently one of my favorite ab workouts. The workout is a 10 minute non-stop intermediate/Advanced ab home workout that will challenge your abs. Perform each exercise for 30 seconds without rest between the moves.&#10;Beginners Workout- Perform 2-3 Rounds&#10;1.Alternating toe touch- 8-12 reps&#10;2. Vertical leg crunch- 8-12 reps&#10;3. Reverse crunch 10-15 reps&#10;4. Side plank 10-20 seconds&#10;5. Elbow Plank 15-30 seconds&#10;&#10;Check Out My Favorite Fitness gear at my Amazon Store&#10;https://www.amazon.com/shop/homeworkoutsbyfittiff&#10;&#10;Follow Me on Instagram&#10;https://www.instagram.com/homeworkoutsbyfittiff/&#10;&#10;Get a copy of my 6 Week Beginner Ab Guide&#10;https://fitnessbyfittiff.com/&#10;&#10;Play it safe by LiQWYD | https://www.instagram.com/liqwyd&#10;Music promoted by https://www.free-stock-music.com&#10;Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 Unported License&#10;https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/deed.en_US"
