    title "Epi. #100: Intense Lower AB Workout w/Dumbbells by Trainer Marcelo."
    description "Fit Body Program @ http://bit.ly/1wCBOQJ &#10;Weight Loss Tips @ http://trainermarcelo.com/ &#10;Subscribe to My Fit Channel @ http://bit.ly/1ftwNZ7 &#10;&#10;Hi there! In this video, I will show you how to work out your abdominal muscles with dumbbells. The workout consists in punching straight up with only one dumbbell and lifting the opposite leg at the same time, then change sides. At last lift both legs and dumbbells straight up, contracting the lower abs when the legs are coming down. Do 10 reps per exercise for 3 rounds. For best results, repeat the same circuit 2-3 more times. Thank you for watching! -- Trainer Marcelo Vazquez.&#10;&#10;*For my full course on how food choices can help you lose weight, go here: http://bit.ly/18gtTFd and get 20% OFF with discount code &#8220;SAVE20&#8221;!&#10;&#10;Filmmaker: Ricardo Pavon&#10;Music: You Tube Audio Library &#10;&#10;Trainer, Marcelo Vazquez, health, fitness, exercise, workout, strength, weight, muscle, gym, obesity, fat, burn, loss, nutrition, diet, abs, core, waist, six-pack, flat stomach, belly,"
